      "role": "user",
      "content": "that's a good overview, thanks. you mentioned the \"early theories\" about genetics and cognitive limitations. even though you said they aren't the majority view now, some people still argue that those variables are a factor when you're looking at the raw data. could you elaborate a bit more on what those specific arguments are? i want to understand the logic they use so i can effectively counter it in my paper.",
